NerdMiner-CYD-Custom
====================

This project is a fork of NerdMiner_v2 by BitMaker (BitMaker-hub):

    https://github.com/BitMaker-hub/NerdMiner_v2
    Copyright (c) 2023 Bitmaker — MIT License

Distributed under the MIT License (see LICENSE), retained from upstream.

Modifications in this fork (Copyright (c) 2026 kleinpanic), also MIT:
  - Non-blocking LEDC speaker/buzzer driver (GPIO26): beep on accepted share,
    alarm on pool/WiFi disconnect, boot chime, volume/mute, web test-tone.
  - microSD support (VSPI/FAT32): CSV mining-stats logging with rotation,
    config.json read/write, path-sanitized file operations, screensaver store.
  - Custom JSON HTTP API (port 80) exposing status + speaker + SD control
    (see docs/API.md), consumed by the companion local control dashboard.

Pipelined classic-ESP32 HW SHA256d mining loop, its self-test, the SW/HW
nonce split and the on-chip SHA engine bench are ported from NerdMiner
Modded by HenrysCat, also MIT (Copyright (c) 2026 HenrysCat):

    https://github.com/HenrysCat/NerdMiner-Modded (522764d)

Hardware target: ESP32-2432S028R "Cheap Yellow Display" (ST7789/ILI9341).
CYD SD + speaker wiring references adapted from
witnessmenow/ESP32-Cheap-Yellow-Display (MIT).

No device secrets (WiFi credentials, wallet, license) are included in this
repository — they are provided at runtime via the WiFiManager portal or an
SD config.json and are git-ignored.
